   "tip": {
    "title": "Numbers like 25",
    "text": "Numbers from 11 to 99 are single words you learn one by one, not built like 'twenty-five': ପଚିଶ (pachisa) = 25, ପଚାଶ (pachasa) = 50. Learn the tens first, then the in-between numbers you meet most. Ages use ବୟସ (age): ମୋ ବୟସ ପଚିଶ ବର୍ଷ = I'm twenty-five."
   }
